  "idea": "Webflow localization update for multi-region landing pages",
  "text": "This new Webflow update makes international search engine optimization accessible to everyone. Ranking organic content across multiple countries usually demands complex sitemap routing and manual hreflang tag injections. Misconfigured regional metadata confuses search crawlers and tanks your rankings across target foreign markets. Webflow Localization automates subdirectories, hreflang tags, and localized metadata dynamically across every CMS collection item. You scale organic global search traffic effortlessly.",
